Number of leading zeros nlz(x) algorithm, binary search 
From the book "Hacker's delight" by Henry S. Warren, Jr., page 78
We cross-check it with an obvious method of counting leading zeros:

s = 0;
for (i = BW - 1; i >= 0; i--)
  if (x & (1 << i))
    break;
  else
    s++;

